    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting it all stop\"? it just feels like if i were gone, the picture would be clean again. like the family could go back to being what they were meant to be without me dragging them down. is that... is that even a dark thought to have? that my absence might actually be a gift to them?",
